# 212 Café — local environment
# The anon/publishable key is PUBLIC by design: it ships to every phone that scans a QR
# code. All protection comes from RLS + the place_order SECURITY DEFINER function, both
# verified by tests/security.test.mjs. No service-role key is needed anywhere in this app.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=YOUR_PUBLISHABLE_KEY
